## Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.

## Build results
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
*.log

## User-specific files
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb

## Rider
.idea/

## ASP.NET Core environment variables
.env
*.db
*.sqlite

## Azure functions local settings
local.settings.json

## Visual Studio Code
.vscode/

## Windows image file caches
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

## Folder config file
Desktop.ini

## Recycle Bin used on file shares
$RECYCLE.BIN/

## NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
*.nuspec
.nuget/

## DotCover
*.dotCover

## JetBrains Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

## Resharper
*.DotSettings.user

## Auto-generated files (e.g., by scaffolding or tools)
Generated_Code/

## Templated files
*.template.*

## Publish directory
publish/
out/
artifacts/

## Coverage reports
coverage/
coverage.cobertura.xml
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
*.lcov

## Test results
TestResults/

## Others
*.DS_Store
*.pem
*.pfx
*.key
*.vsidx
